        "sid": "ISA 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, mwanta wakashakama muwanta chaloŋa, atulamba akayula mwawuŋaji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wakekala neyi kwakubatama mpepela nikwakweyama nvula; neyi tuloŋa twameji twamwawuma, neyi wulelu weloladeneni mwituŋa dazeyaloŋa antu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesu awantu amonaŋa hiyakela lwiduku, matu awantu atiyaloŋa akatiyilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchima wamuntu walundumukilaŋa ansaŋu jakulundumukila wakeluka chakashinshi, madimi awakwakukukuma akanyakala kuhosha chalumbuluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chintaama hiyakamutena nawacheŋa nawu kalambaku, mukwachifwa hiyakamutena nawu mukwakuhanaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chintaama wakahosha yawuntaama, muchima windi wakakoŋa yakuluwa, kulonda akelaŋa yakasekesha kakusekesha Nzambi, kulonda kumutena Yehova mwakuluwalala, kulonda amukaŋeshi mukwanzala kudya, akaŋeshinawa mukwampwila kunwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yakalakalaŋayi nachu mukwachifwayatama; wakasakasaŋa yuma yatama kulonda akisaŋani adizoza namazu akutwamba, nihahoshaŋayi chachiwahi mukwákubula yuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa kalamba wafuukulaŋa yawulamba, walamata yawulamba hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ambanda mwashakama chazo-o, nyamukenu mutiyi izu dami; enu anyana awambanda mwashakama chakadi kwakama, tiyililenu munukuhosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ambanda mwashakama chakadi kwakama, akayikabisha mafuku amavulu akubadika mumwaka wumu; chilaaka chakudya vinyu hichakekala kwoku, hawukuŋawilu hihakamwekanaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ambanda mwashakama chazo-o, zaalenu; enu mwashakama chakadi kwakama, kabenu; divúulenu, mwikali nzekesi, vwalenu yikeleyi mumbunda jenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakwata mbimbanamutu nakudila maha atiyilaŋa awu kuwaha, namuvinyu wasoŋelaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseki dawantu ami dakamena yikwata nanyiŋa, mwalalakwaamu yakamena nihamatala adiŋa akuzaŋa ajalila amumukala wadisanswilaŋa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwalala itala damwanta; nimukala wadiŋi nawantu amavulu akabu ukamu; nikumpidi nikukaposhi kakutalila, kwakekala kwakupundila anyama yinkelenkesu yawu haya nyaka, kwakuzaŋajalila yimbulu yamwisaŋa, nikuwudiilu wanyikanka yayimuna; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nichichakechilawu hadetu Spirituyakufuma mwiwulu, hadiŋa isana damukunkulu hakabalumuka iha dasoŋaŋa, niiha dasoŋaŋa akadifuukula nawu lusesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu wuŋaji wakashakama mwisaŋa damukunkulu, nikuloŋa kwakashakama mwiha dasoŋaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
